    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To troubleshoot the \"Connection Error 404\" on the Zenith Smart Hub, follow these 2 steps:\n\n1. Restart your router and modem, as sometimes a simple reboot can resolve connectivity issues. Ensure that your router and modem are turned off for 30 seconds and then turn them back on.\n2. Check your Wi-Fi network password and ensure it's spelled correctly. If you're using a saved network, try editing it and re-saving it to ensure accuracy.\n\nBy taking these simple steps, you should be able to resolve the Connection Error 404 and reconnect to the internet.",
